00:50:44.800 --> 00:50:47.130
It is so readily transferable

1164
00:50:47.130 --> 00:50:48.330
what the Army has discovered.

1165
00:50:48.330 --> 00:50:50.630
The Armies used the science of The Awakened Brain,

1166
