1213
00:52:45.573 --> 00:52:49.440
All right, so using the lens of epidemiology,

1214
00:52:49.440 --> 00:52:52.730
it was clear that those threads of lived human spirituality

1215
00:52:52.730 --> 00:52:55.030
which are protective against addiction,

1216
00:52:55.030 --> 00:52:57.980
which are part of our strengthening and deepening

1217
00:52:57.980 --> 00:52:59.760
in the path of recovery and renewal

1218
00:52:59.760 --> 00:53:02.480
from trauma or depression

1219
00:53:02.480 --> 00:53:07.320
where this sense of transcendent relationship, right?

1220
00:53:07.320 --> 00:53:10.160
The capacity to perceive transcendent relationship

1221
00:53:10.160 --> 00:53:11.423
and that might be shared.

1222
00:53:12.520 --> 00:53:15.640
So knowing that through the lens of epidemiology

1223
00:53:15.640 --> 00:53:18.620
there was something heritable built into us.

1224
00:53:18.620 --> 00:53:20.510
A form of spiritual awareness

