00:53:33.550 --> 00:53:38.313
watch people engaged in a deep transcendent relationship.

1229
00:53:39.720 --> 00:53:40.740
So that's what we did.

1230
00:53:40.740 --> 00:53:43.130
We sat around the table for 18 months

1231
00:53:43.130 --> 00:53:46.550
and used previously validated ways of working

1232
00:53:46.550 --> 00:53:50.040
an MRI studies to come up with an in-scanner task

1233
