00:54:48.460 --> 00:54:52.150
that when we tell a story, a memory,

1257
00:54:52.150 --> 00:54:54.300
in a way that's very palpable and rich

1258
00:54:54.300 --> 00:54:58.110
and has lots of sensory points real anchors in it

1259
00:54:58.110 --> 00:54:59.670
that bring us back in time.

1260
00:54:59.670 --> 00:55:02.500
We elicit the same neural correlates as if we were there

1261
00:55:02.500 --> 00:55:04.100
plus memory, right?

1262
00:55:04.100 --> 00:55:06.100
And Mark (indistinct) working with (indistinct)

1263
00:55:06.100 --> 00:55:09.610
had become one of the leading experts around addiction.

1264
00:55:09.610 --> 00:55:13.180
And he had found that the addiction loop in our brain,

1265
00:55:13.180 --> 00:55:15.200
the insulin striatum is the same.

1266
00:55:15.200 --> 00:55:17.540
Whether we are addicted to alcohol and drugs

1267
00:55:17.540 --> 00:55:20.330
or pornography and the internet or gambling, it's the same.

1268
00:55:20.330 --> 00:55:21.710
I've got to have it, right?

1269
00:55:21.710 --> 00:55:23.819
So they had worked together,

1270
00:55:23.819 --> 00:55:25.520
(indistinct) and Mark in the past,

1271
00:55:25.520 --> 00:55:29.580
developing this in-scanner task when it came to craving.

1272
00:55:29.580 --> 00:55:31.920
When it came to telling stories of addiction,

1273
00:55:31.920 --> 00:55:35.270
hungry and I need to have the drug, I need to have...

1274
00:55:35.270 --> 00:55:36.390
I've got to get to Vegas,

1275
00:55:36.390 --> 00:55:38.640
I've got to have this roll of the dice.

1276
00:55:38.640 --> 00:55:42.417
Well, when I approached them I said,

1277
00:55:42.417 --> 00:55:45.040
"We know from epidemiology that there's nothing

1278
00:55:45.040 --> 00:55:47.200
that's protective against addiction there's a strong,

1279
00:55:47.200 --> 00:55:48.730
personal spirituality.

1280
00:55:48.730 --> 00:55:50.980
Can we watch that in the scanner?"

1281
00:55:50.980 --> 00:55:53.590
And of course, as open-minded creative scientists,

1282
00:55:53.590 --> 00:55:54.700
Mark and (indistinct) were thrilled.

1283
00:55:54.700 --> 00:55:56.690
We sat down for a year and a half

1284
00:55:56.690 --> 00:55:58.970
and we took the following question

1285
00:55:58.970 --> 00:56:00.120
after a year and a half of inquiry

1286
