1289
00:56:10.150 --> 00:56:13.210
Some people say God, Jesus, Allah, Hashem.

1290
00:56:13.210 --> 00:56:17.300
Some people say the universe or a oneness with all life.

1291
00:56:17.300 --> 00:56:20.570
But tell us a time where you felt a deep connection

1292
00:56:20.570 --> 00:56:23.370
with a deeper, deeper presence of life

1293
00:56:23.370 --> 00:56:24.913
that was loving and guiding.

1294
00:56:26.170 --> 00:56:27.610
Nobody was confused.

1295
00:56:27.610 --> 00:56:29.600
18 to 25 year olds in New Haven.

1296
00:56:29.600 --> 00:56:30.620
A lot of them were Yale students.

1297
00:56:30.620 --> 00:56:32.380
A lot of them were agnostic.

1298
00:56:32.380 --> 00:56:33.710
Some spiritual but not religious.

1299
00:56:33.710 --> 00:56:36.450
