1300
00:56:36.450 --> 00:56:40.090
Nobody was surprised, everyone had an important experience.

1301
00:56:40.090 --> 00:56:41.220
Everyone.

1302
00:56:41.220 --> 00:56:42.300
And then how many people?

1303
00:56:42.300 --> 00:56:43.780
What was the population size?

1304
00:56:43.780 --> 00:56:45.307
Well, okay so in order to...

1305
00:56:45.307 --> 00:56:47.810
And an MRI studies is there's often very small samples.

1306
00:56:47.810 --> 00:56:49.520
You can even publish study with like 10.

1307
00:56:49.520 --> 00:56:51.570
But we had about 30 people

1308
00:56:51.570 --> 00:56:53.720
who went through every phase of this study.

1309
00:56:55.270 --> 00:56:58.330
And in this study, whether they were Christian, Catholic,

1310
00:56:58.330 --> 00:57:01.363
Jewish, Muslim, Hindu, spiritual but not religious.

1311
00:57:02.260 --> 00:57:04.560
No matter what their background was,

